==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ru|хоро́шій}} {{ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ru|orv|хорошь}} (13th century). Cognate with {{cog|uk|хоро́ший}}, {{cog|be|харашы́цца||to boast, to swagger}}. Further etymology unclear; probably originally abbreviated from the -шь form of {{m|ru|хоро́брый}}, hence cognate with {{m|ru|хра́брый||brave}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|хоро́ший}}
* {{audio|Ru-хороший.ogg|audio|lang=ru}}
* {{hyphenation|хо|ро́|ший|lang=ru}}

